# Memory: elephant / goldfish

## Elephant (pin — tracked)

Keep short and durable:

- `AGENTS.md` — entrypoint + loop
- `docs/architecture.md`, `docs/anti-leak.md`, ADRs
- Active `task-plans/` + current card
- Slim product: requirements / feature catalog / submission text

Agents re-read these; do not rely on chat history for frozen decisions.

## Goldfish (local — gitignored)

- Long Q&A, assumptions dumps → `local-notes/`
- Draft decks, scratch, meeting notes
- Failed experiments narrative

## Promotion rule

When a local-note decision becomes binding: write slim formal slice under `docs/` or ADR. Leave the long discussion in `local-notes/`.

Never commit goldfish folders. Never paste proprietary dumps into elephant docs.
